# RaidBossType3AnaisAggressive (29096, Anais), level 1 like the level 1 character, standing
# in its territory, is hit for 22: it stays where it is, and RaidBossStandard wants to attack
# the character at 22 / (1 + 7) * 20000. Its see-creature hook, its return home out of its
# territory (hit, idle, a cast ended, a hit on its party) and the 1 s timer that drops its
# attack desires and hate are in tests/ai/raid_boss6_test.go: the format moves no NPC out of
# its territory and places no template privates.
character Hunter 1
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossStandard
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossParty
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossType3
script script.ai.individual.Monster.RaidBoss.RaidBossParty.RaidBossType3AnaisAggressive
npc anais 29096 RaidBoss 100 0 0

hit anais 22
  desires anais attack(player)=55000
